                  %mn 1
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (A,B;D,C) = -1
            as well. We say that this ratio is harmonic and that the quadruple
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
